{"version":1,"content":"<p>MIRROR成員邱士縉（Stanley）與李炘頤（Alina）日前於峇里舉行浪漫婚禮，兩人已於昨晚（27日）低調回港，Stanley今日亦已極速投入工作。</p><p>Alina於今晚在社交平台上載了一段峇里婚禮的浪漫短片，並感性留言分享心聲。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:21:40.275271+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T11:57:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T08:38:16.146214+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T12:18:15.903759+00:00","content_hash":"3e198967ff628fee5726786ddf11fc528a9de1668c2f60b523376473d0b6d5e4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}